# Enterprise Lender Product Catalogue (CO-LM-004)

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Commercial offer catalogue SSOT

## Principle

Lender–product commercial offers (`LENDERS_BY_PRODUCT`) are **Enterprise Master Data**.

They must **never** reside in marketing websites, landing pages, or `src/lib/site.ts`.

## SSOT

| Concern | Path |
|---------|------|
| Types | `src/types/enterprise-lender-product-catalogue.ts` |
| Catalogue | `src/constants/enterprise-lender-product-catalogue/` |
| Lib facade | `src/lib/enterprise-lender-product-catalogue/` |

## Consumers

Enterprise Lender Directory · Insights / Mission Control · (legacy marketing Eligibility Gate may import the enterprise SSOT only)

## Forbidden

- Defining a parallel `LENDERS_BY_PRODUCT` in `site.ts` or COMPASS UI helpers
- Recalculating offer rates outside this catalogue for the same published rows
